{
 "readings": {
  "E1": "calendar: W1 = D26's dates 2014-09-01 -> 2019-01-02 (1,070 sessions); W2 = each book's D17 dates of the EXTENDED published NAV from its first date (SCMO_0007: 2019-01-04) to END = the last row of the three D03 Master files (2026-10-30); rows after END are never used. As T14 E1",
  "E2": "decision dates = T0 and the last session of every later ISO week; the decision at the last session is made and not traded (T14 E2)",
  "E3": "label = latest Master row dated <= decision date, per index and for MAUc1 (W1: D24b, W2: D24); regime IN / OUT-BUY / OUT-SELL from the three SIGNs and g; B = the indices whose own SIGN is BUY, k = |B|; the Smallcap 100 rows are sliced to >= 2011-11-25",
  "E4": "targets per rule from T15.md 2.1: absolute shares (parent e, GOLDBEES, cash, one per index); the six T14 rules map (e, gw) to e, (1-e)gw, (1-e)(1-gw), 0 so their path is T14's; -idx in OUT-SELL = cash and each index of B at 1/(k+1); one function `rule_targets` serves every run",
  "E5": "initial position at T0's close, no cost: the target of the decision at T0 (IN: the basket in force, drifted from its availableDate, scaled to NAV 1; OUT: the sleeve; e = 0.5: half the drifted basket and half GOLDBEES; -idx in OUT-SELL: cash and each index of B at its T0 close)",
  "E6": "stock fill = OHLC4 of the Eikon bar (close if open/high/low is blank; the last close if no bar); GOLDBEES fill = T03's de-spike with the MCX range of the window's file (W1: D24b daily, W2: D12), raw OHLC4 where the range is missing; index fill = OHLC4 of the index's own bar (D25 in W1, D25c in W2); an index trade on a session without a bar stops the run",
  "E7": "costs: T14's `trade` generalised to index lines (cost = ow x value traded over every line, stocks, GOLDBEES, cash and each index, then every target scaled by (V-cost)/V)",
  "E8": "a basket takes effect on the first session on or after its availableDate; skipped baskets dropped; weights renormalised. While e = 1 a basket change is the full reset trade; while 0 < e < 1 (the -half comparators) it is T14's D1 partial trade; while e = 0 (-idx in OUT-SELL included) nothing is traded",
  "E9": "trade kinds: switch_in / switch_out (e crosses 0 or 1 between IN and OUT-BUY; for -orig also IN <-> OUT-SELL), sleeve_rebalance, regime_in / regime_out (into / out of OUT-SELL, rules other than -orig), index_set_change (-idx: B changed while OUT-SELL on both sides), basket_change",
  "E10": "cash level: the extended LBES (D11) as-of on sessions; R2 'liq': W1 liquidEtfFinal (LIQUIDCASE) over the whole window, W2 LBES to the session before 2024-01-24 then LIQUIDCASE returns; no accrual",
  "E11": "constant mix at each rule's own average shares: parent f_p = mean of e over the weekly decisions, GOLDBEES f_g, cash f_c and each index f_i = the means of the rule's target shares; rebalanced at every decision date's next session and at every basket change while f_p > 0 (T14 E11 generalised); initial stock holding = drifted basket scaled by f_p",
  "E12": "R3: W1 starts at the first D26 session on or after 2015-01-02, W2 'live' at the first D17 session on or after 2021-11-01, each with its own first state (both start in OUT-SELL, so -idx starts holding cash and the indices of B at their closes)",
  "E13": "ledger span (T15.md 2.4, 'first fill to last fill'): a = the session on which the first decision of the span is traded (the session after it; T0 for the window's first decision), b = the session on which the decision that ends the span is traded (or the last session); returns are close[b] / close[a] - 1 of each instrument and of each rule's 20.8 bps NAV (parent = hold-parent 0-cost NAV)",
  "E14": "R4: for each OUT-SELL spell s, -idx runs with B = empty (its target is -liq's) on the decisions of spell s only; every other week is the real rule; 20.8 bps, full window, LBES",
  "E15": "R5: every index's OHLC4 and close of session i (i = 0 at T0 on the book's calendar) multiplied by (1 - 0.005 / 252)^i, for -idx and every other rule (the others hold no index); 20.8 bps",
  "E16": "index bars: a calendar session with no bar carries the last close (marking only); counted per index; a trade that involves an index line on such a session stops the run"
 },
